  "originalText": "The door opened.\n\nShe really waited.\n\nThe light was red.\n\nA bell rang.\n\nHe still waited.\n\nEcho.\n\nEcho.\n\nFirst paragraph.\n\nSecond paragraph.\n\nStyled.\n\nMoved passage.\n\n\n\nAcross first.\n\nAcross second.\n\n",
  "revisedText": "The door slowly opened.\n\nShe waited.\n\nThe light was blue.\n\nA quiet silver bell rang.\n\nHe waited.\n\nEcho. Again.\n\nEcho.\n\nFirst paragraph.\n\nSecond paragraph.\n\nStyled.\n\n\n\nMoved passage.\n\nAcross first.\n\nAcross second.\n\n",
